# The repository root .gitignore (from the 2019 project) ignores LaTeX and log outputs.
# The research record tracks these files (audit logs, run logs, LaTeX build files), so re-include them here.
# *.o and *.exe stay ignored (compiled binaries).
!*.log
!*.aux
!*.out
!*.toc
!*.dvi
!*.bbl
!*.blg
!*.synctex
!*.synctex.gz
!*.pdfsync
!*.nav
!*.snm
!*-converted-to.*

